{"id":"n62391-1-14","stage":1,"title":"전체 · 全体","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62391-1-14-1","ko":"내일 소풍은 박물관으로 간다며?","zh":"听说明天郊游要去博物馆？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소풍은","meaning":"远足，郊游，野游","explanation":"소풍：远足，郊游，野游；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"소풍","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26854","senseId":"1","lemma":"소풍","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"박물관으로","meaning":"博物馆","explanation":"박물관：博物馆；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"박물관","audio":"/audio/9c844c75334ef5795590.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36677","senseId":"1","lemma":"박물관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간다며?","meaning":"传到，送到","explanation":"가다：传到，送到；ㄴ다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"19","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"687c92f20434bf39","term":"소풍","zh":"远足，郊游，野游","audio":"/audio/687c92f20434bf39a11f.mp3","entryId":"26854","definition":"为了享受美景或做游戏而去野外。","pronunciation":["소풍"]},{"id":"9c844c75334ef579","term":"박물관","zh":"博物馆","audio":"/audio/9c844c75334ef5795590.mp3","entryId":"36677","definition":"搜集、保存和陈列文物或艺术品以供人们欣赏或研究的设施。","pronunciation":["방물관"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"传到，送到","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"话或消息等被告知或被转达。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/54c9ff2da38a17449f29.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62391-1-14-2","ko":"응, 우리 학교 학생 전체가 가기에는 너무 좁을 것 같은데.","zh":"嗯，全校学生都去的话，那里恐怕太小了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학생","meaning":"学生","explanation":"학생：学生","readings":[{"term":"학생","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31670","senseId":"1","lemma":"학생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전체가","meaning":"全体","explanation":"전체：全体；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"전체","audio":"/audio/a4b69faf0c1113faf1f7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62391","senseId":"1","lemma":"전체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가기에는","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좁을","meaning":"窄小","explanation":"좁다：窄小；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"1","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은데.","meaning":"要是，如果是","explanation":"같다：要是，如果是；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"4","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"f24650b42089c29f","term":"학생","zh":"学生","audio":"/audio/f24650b42089c29f9027.mp3","entryId":"31670","definition":"在学校学习的人。","pronunciation":["학쌩"]},{"id":"a4b69faf0c1113fa","term":"전체","zh":"全体","audio":"/audio/a4b69faf0c1113faf1f7.mp3","entryId":"62391","definition":"把由一个个或部分的集合组成的东西作为一个对象时所指的该对象。","pronunciation":["전체"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"窄小","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"面或底部等的面积小。","pronunciation":["좁따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"要是，如果是","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示“如果在某种状况或条件下”。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/68ecb0a78f3c356c8c58.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.32,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62391","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":41,"sequenceScore":1.8721,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，全校学生都去的话，那里恐怕太小了。","昨天我房间里突然飞进了一只大鸟，对吧！","听说明天郊游要去博物馆？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，全校学生都去的话，那里恐怕太小了。","听说明天郊游要去博物馆？","昨天我房间里突然飞进了一只大鸟，对吧！"],"answer":0}]}
